stie's contribution to theatre: her murder mystery play \"The Mousetrap\" is the world's longest-running show, and she was the first female playwright to have three plays performing simultaneously in the West End."], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 1, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 1927, "elapsed_seconds": 137.00073766708374}
