 a part-talkie, making it one of the last – if not \"the\" last – silent horror films."], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 1, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 2964, "elapsed_seconds": 181.38679385185242}
